{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DDoD</strong> is a top-down roguelite shooter with survival elements, built around a massive map. Play solo or team up with a few other players for co-op runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at the edge of the <strong>Purple Lands</strong> - a sealed-off industrial region struck by a sentient, mind-like substance known as <strong>the Fog</strong>. Exposure twists DNA in unpredictable ways. The cautious and the careful sometimes gain abilities no human was meant to have\u2026 but everything has a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey leads to the very heart of the industrial wasteland. Across swamps, forests, and dead towns - to the source. Along the way, you\u2019ll scavenge, customize your weapons, and push your luck further than it should ever go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/a714d9fcb56dfe669a11061a892fbca0.poster.avif?t=1769026279\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/a714d9fcb56dfe669a11061a892fbca0.webm?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/a714d9fcb56dfe669a11061a892fbca0.mp4?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENTER THE PURPLE LANDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a thriving industrial hub, now a wound in the countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zone is littered with abandoned towns, derelict factories, military checkpoints, and secret research bunkers. Built using real-world topography, the terrain shifts between dense forests, swamps, and industrial ruins. Expect dynamic weather, a full day/night cycle, and warped climates where geography itself has been altered by anomaly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/cfb67aeda3ba443fabe82cee1bf26b67.poster.avif?t=1769026279\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/cfb67aeda3ba443fabe82cee1bf26b67.webm?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/cfb67aeda3ba443fabe82cee1bf26b67.mp4?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET TO THE SOURCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run starts at the base. From there, the route is yours to choose, take side quests to stockpile gear, upgrade your loadout, and explore points of interest. Or gamble everything on a straight shot into the Fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/1bdc1ecad901d3719690a3a26c2725cf.poster.avif?t=1769026279\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/1bdc1ecad901d3719690a3a26c2725cf.webm?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/1bdc1ecad901d3719690a3a26c2725cf.mp4?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE FOG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fog warps all living things, turning humans and animals into nightmarish mutations. But it can also be a weapon in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Fog or inject a <strong>Booster</strong> to gain extraordinary powers. Just remember: the transformation is irreversible, and the side effects are\u2026 unpredictable. Things here get very weird, very fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/b2f844465f5131200ab1b8d593559364.poster.avif?t=1769026279\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/b2f844465f5131200ab1b8d593559364.webm?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/b2f844465f5131200ab1b8d593559364.mp4?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT FAST, LOUD, AND SMART</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weapon handling, authentic ballistics, and limited ammo. Enemies react to noise, light, and player tactics. Fight demand strategy - a pack of mutant hounds and an elite squad of infected mercenaries are two very different things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fog can jam your weapons without warning, forcing brutal melee encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEET THE LOCALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bunkers of the Purple Lands are home to a cast of fully-voiced, eccentric survivors:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>Basile</strong>, the grumpy gate guard, to <strong>Lucia</strong>, an arms dealer grandmother, and <strong>Mort</strong>, the gossip-spreading bartender. They\u2019re all a bit crazy and in this place, that\u2019s just another required skill. How\u2019d you survive otherwise?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/caaf2bd5b8178d2708da4f72b114213e.poster.avif?t=1769026279\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/caaf2bd5b8178d2708da4f72b114213e.webm?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/caaf2bd5b8178d2708da4f72b114213e.mp4?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OTHER KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-Op. </strong>Play solo or with up to three friends. Share ammo, revive teammates, and argue over who goes into The Fog first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression. </strong>DDoD features a variety of loadouts, points of interest, and weapon modifications. Key upgrades stay, but you\u2019ll have to search for new gear or loot off your body if you die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Points of Interest. </strong>Discover military outposts, secret labs, underground tunnels and The Fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Customization. </strong>Customize your loadout with scopes, silencers, elemental damage mods like fire, cold, electric and other fog-powered attachments. The right buildup is crucial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battery Management. </strong>Your Protection device is a portable safe zone that dispels The Fog when turned on.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2468200?t=1769026279","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/6fe92d2be18641bff0619cf3c8b3ec3f0b6cc150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769026279","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/c1686eceb4be3f8bcebe4fc85c9c2c75b31c1e33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769026279","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/c1686eceb4be3f8bcebe4fc85c9c2c75b31c1e33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769026279","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DDoD</strong> is a top-down roguelite shooter with survival elements, built around a massive map. Play solo or team up with a few other players for co-op runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at the edge of the <strong>Purple Lands</strong> - a sealed-off industrial region struck by a sentient, mind-like substance known as <strong>the Fog</strong>. Exposure twists DNA in unpredictable ways. The cautious and the careful sometimes gain abilities no human was meant to have\u2026 but everything has a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey leads to the very heart of the industrial wasteland. Across swamps, forests, and dead towns - to the source. Along the way, you\u2019ll scavenge, customize your weapons, and push your luck further than it should ever go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\