s/b2f844465f5131200ab1b8d593559364.mp4?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT FAST, LOUD, AND SMART</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weapon handling, authentic ballistics, and limited ammo. Enemies react to noise, light, and player tactics. Fight demand strategy - a pack of mutant hounds and an elite squad of infected mercenaries are two very different things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fog can jam your weapons without warning, forcing brutal melee encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEET THE LOCALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bunkers of the Purple Lands are home to a cast of fully-voiced, eccentric survivors:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>Basile</strong>, the grumpy gate guard, to <strong>Lucia</strong>, an arms dealer grandmother, and <strong>Mort</strong>, the gossip-spreading bartender. They\u2019re all a bit crazy and in this place, that\u2019s just another required skill. How\u2019d you survive otherwise?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/caaf2bd5b8178d2708da4f72b114213e.poster.avif?t=1769026279\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/caaf2bd5b8178d2708da4f72b114213e.webm?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/extras/caaf2bd5b8178d2708da4f72b114213e.mp4?t=1769026279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OTHER KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-Op. </strong>Play solo or with up to three friends. Share ammo, revive teammates, and argue over who goes into The Fog first.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression. </strong>DDoD features a variety of loadouts, points of interest, and weapon modifications. Key upgrades stay, but you\u2019ll have to search for new gear or loot off your body if you die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Points of Interest. </strong>Discover military outposts, secret labs, underground tunnels and The Fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Customization. </strong>Customize your loadout with scopes, silencers, elemental damage mods like fire, cold, electric and other fog-powered attachments. The right buildup is crucial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battery Management. </strong>Your Protection device is a portable safe zone that dispels The Fog when turned on.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","developers":["The Future Entertainment Company"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468200/5763406260a17a92e3eaa79b1bcb7c1fdd3ae535/header.jpg?t=1769026279","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2468200/123322170/37365090287b2cc694cbc7e344b7c2a82379db58/1755178540/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761338841","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2468200/123322170/37365090287b2cc694cbc7e344b7c2a82379db58/1755178540/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761338841","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2468200/123322170/37365090287b2cc694cbc7e344b7c2a82379db58/1755178540/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761338841","id":257183166,"name":"Official Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183166/4973389a3ed4fff5